---
// LAB — inspirado em Aceternity "Moving Border" (botão) + "Glowing Stars" (fundo ambiente)
// Reaproveita os keyframes float/float-alt já existentes no Layout.astro.
---
<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="cta-container glass-card fade-in-scale cta-v2">
    <div class="ambient-blob blob-1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ambient-blob blob-2" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <h2>Escale seu Atendimento e Vendas Hoje Mesmo</h2>
    <p>Seja você uma pequena empresa ou uma grande corporação, o ChatZP entrega eficiência e resultado imediato.</p>

    <div class="moving-border-wrap">
      <a href="https://wa.me/5531987771763" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-button-large moving-border-btn">
        Solicitar Minha Demonstração Gratuita
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @property --angle {
    syntax: '<angle>';
    initial-value: 0deg;
    inherits: false;
  }

  .cta-v2 { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .ambient-blob {
    position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(50px); opacity: 0.35; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .blob-1 { width: 260px; height: 260px; background: var(--accent); top: -80px; left: -60px; animation: float 7s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .blob-2 { width: 220px; height: 220px; background: var(--primary-light); bottom: -70px; right: -40px; animation: float-alt 8s ease-in-out infinite; }

  .moving-border-wrap {
    position: relative; display: inline-block; border-radius: 15px; padding: 2px;
    background: conic-gradient(from var(--angle), transparent 0%, var(--accent) 15%, transparent 30%);
    animation: spin-border 3.5s linear infinite;
  }
  .moving-border-btn { position: relative; margin: 0; }

  @keyframes spin-border { to { --angle: 360deg; } }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ambient-blob { animation: none; }
    .moving-border-wrap { animation: none; background: var(--accent); }
  }
</style>
